<title>UK: BA names Tempest Europe area cargo manager.</title>
<headline>BA names Tempest Europe area cargo manager.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways World Cargo said it has appointed Warren Tempest as its new western and central Europe area sales manager, based in Frankfurt.</p>
<p>He was previously the company's UK-based manager-national accounts, a position that has yet to be filled.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel +44 171 542 7706; fax +5017</p>
<p>-www.racs. com</p>
</text>
